  "details": "The current \"Req Invite\" function seems to have some problems.\n(1) You can send multiple Req Invite.\n　(Do you think there are cases where you want to send multiple Req Invite to one person?)\n(2) An error sound is made when the Req Invite is pressed.\n\nBecause of this, there is a great deal of confusion when a large number of Req Invite are sent at events, etc. \nSpecifically, there have been many cases of people mistakenly believing that their Req Invite has not been sent, and then repeatedly sending Req Invite.\nIt will take some time to fix (1), but (2) can be fixed immediately, so please consider this.",
